      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "EA sends OrderSwap(); api/app.py\nstores\nit; nothing reads it. EA does not\npoll\nMODE_SWAPLONG/SHORT at all, so\nthere is\nno carry SIGNAL. Breakeven\nfinancing is\n0.340 bps/day vs 0.5\u20132 retail.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EA sends OrderSwap(); api/app.py\nstores\nit; nothing reads it. EA does not\npoll\nMODE_SWAPLONG/SHORT at all, so\nthere is\nno carry SIGNAL. Breakeven\nfinancing is\n0.340 bps/day vs 0.5\u20132 retail.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
