      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2181636,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Was a CLIFF: flat 0.5% risk all\nthe way\nto risk_max_drawdown_pct, then\nentries\nblocked dead. Now sizing.py\ndrawdown_scaled_fraction() ramps\nrisk\ndown as equity falls, floored at\n0.25x.\nOrthogonal to the ATR stop\n(account\nstate vs instrument state), so the\ntwo\ncompose without double-counting.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Was a CLIFF: flat 0.5% risk all\nthe way\nto risk_max_drawdown_pct, then\nentries\nblocked dead. Now sizing.py\ndrawdown_scaled_fraction() ramps\nrisk\ndown as equity falls, floored at\n0.25x.\nOrthogonal to the ATR stop\n(account\nstate vs instrument state), so the\ntwo\ncompose without double-counting.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
